    "detail": "I booked a family suite with one room featuring two single beds and another room with a double bed, connected by a living room. I'm traveling with one older child, so I added an extra bed in the living room, which means we effectively have three bedrooms. The location is excellent, with Big C right next door, breakfast with a view of Central World, and the reception staff is very friendly. The hotel also welcomed me with a plate of fruit. Although the interior of the hotel is a bit old-fashioned and in a classic style, it was not an issue for me as long as it was clean. If I had to point out one downside, it would be the hallway, which is carpeted and has a slightly musty smell. However, the smell is not noticeable in the rooms. Overall, for the price, this is an excellent choice.",
